  "body": "Brand new, beautifully finished and ready for immediate possession, this substantial five-bedroom home delivers something increasingly difficult to find in modern developments - genuine space inside and out.\r\n\r\nWith CCC and Title already issued, there is no waiting around. Simply secure the home and start planning your move.\r\n\r\nDesigned with larger and multi-generational families in mind, the impressive floor plan features five bedrooms, three ensuites and four-and-a-half bathrooms in total, providing exceptional flexibility for family members, teenagers, guests or extended family.\r\n\r\nInternal-access single garaging is complemented by ample off-street parking, with additional space that could be ideal for the boat - a valuable bonus this close to the Half Moon Bay lifestyle.\r\n\r\nBut what really sets this home apart is outside.\r\n\r\nUnlike many brand-new properties where outdoor space is at a premium, this home enjoys a generous rear section, giving children room to play, pets space to roam and the whole family an outdoor area they can genuinely use and enjoy.\r\n\r\nAdding another modern advantage, solar panels provide a more energy-efficient approach to everyday living, helping reduce reliance on grid power and potentially keeping household electricity costs down.\r\n\r\nAnd if this particular home isn't quite the right fit, there are two additional brand-new homes within the same development also available for purchase, with CCC and Titles issued for all three.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n* Brand new with CCC and Title issued\r\n* Five generous bedrooms\r\n* Three bedrooms with ensuites\r\n* Four-and-a-half bathrooms in total\r\n* Internal-access single garage\r\n* Excellent additional off-street parking\r\n* Potential space for the boat\r\n* Generous rear section rarely found with new builds\r\n* Fantastic outdoor space for children and pets\r\n* Solar panels for greater energy efficiency\r\n* Central heating and cooling\r\n\r\nTwo additional homes within the development also available\r\n\r\nMore bedrooms. More bathrooms. More outdoor space. Brand-new living without the usual compromises.\r\n\r\nOpen homes as advertised or reach out for a private viewing. Very easy access. Contact Simon Davies or Filicia Kuang",
